- id: valve_2_max_runtime_guard
  alias: 'Front Lawn Valve 2 - Max Runtime Failsafe'
  description: 'Independent hard safety cap for the front-lawn valve. If switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2 stays on for 100 minutes for ANY reason (watering automation bug, HA restart mid-run, manual, device glitch), force it off and notify. Raised from 60 min on 2026-07-13: legitimate deep-watering runs can now reach 90 min (SI maximum_duration 5400 s at the calibrated 13.4 L/min flow). Re-pointed 2026-07-14 back to the ZHA valve (switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2) after the coordinator was relocated and the link recovered (LQI 17 -> 100, 6/6 command delivery). Belt-and-suspenders backstop to lawn_watering_start_cycle; always enabled.'
  mode: single
  triggers:
  - trigger: state
    entity_id: switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2
    to: 'on'
    for:
      minutes: 100
  conditions: []
  actions:
  # This is the LAST line of defence, so its close is verified + retried (up to 5x)
  # rather than fire-and-forget — a dropped Zigbee command here would leave water running.
  - repeat:
      sequence:
      - action: switch.turn_off
        target:
          entity_id: switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2
        continue_on_error: true
      - wait_template: "{{ is_state('switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2', 'off') }}"
        timeout: "00:00:30"
        continue_on_timeout: true
      until: "{{ is_state('switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2', 'off') or repeat.index >= 5 }}"
  - action: notify.mobile_app_cph2655
    data:
      title: >-
        {{ "🚨 Front lawn valve force-closed (100-min cap)" if is_state('switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2','off')
           else "🚨🚨 LAWN VALVE STUCK OPEN - GO SHUT THE TAP" }}
      message: >-
        valve_2 was on for 100 minutes and hit the hard safety cap.
        {{ "Force-closed successfully — check why the watering automation did not close it."
           if is_state('switch.tze284_8zizsafo_ts0601_valve_2','off')
           else "IT DID NOT CLOSE after 5 attempts and is STILL RUNNING — shut the tap manually." }}
